OL,3,AGuinea orders residents to clean up the
OL,4,Acapital months after deadly rubbish
OL,5,Adump collapse
OL,6,
OL,7,FGuinea has ordered residents to do a
OL,8,Fmass clean-up of the capital, Conakry,
OL,9,Fmonths after a rubbish landfill
OL,10,Fcollapsed, killing dozens of people.
OL,12,FPrime Minister Amadou Oury Bah on
OL,13,FWednesday announced a deadline of 31
OL,14,FDecember to clear rubbish in the city
OL,15,Fand its suburbs, which has seen an
OL,16,Fincrease in illegal dumping in recent
OL,17,Fmonths.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,0,100
