OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AGuinea orders residents to clean up the
OL,4,Acapital months after deadly rubbish
OL,5,Adump collapse
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn August heavy rains caused a
OL,8,Flandslide at the capital's main waste
OL,9,Fdump, with the rubbish collapsing onto
OL,10,Fhomes killing 31 people and injuring
OL,11,Fothers.
OL,13,FThe site in the city's Dar es Salaam
OL,14,Farea was subsequently closed
OL,15,Fpermanently, which has led to piles of
OL,16,Frubbish accumulating outside homes and
OL,17,Fon the streets.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,0,100
